## Recommendation

**Target**: **L07 (Trade-off Mitigation)**

**Rationale**: `L07` is the mandatory next step in the canonical 19-layer architecture. With `L06` now implemented, `L07` is the only candidate that satisfies the "Build upstream first" principle without missing dependencies. Most critically, implementing `L07` directly prevents `L08` (Design) from hallucinating constraints by formalizing the transition from trade-off analysis to safe system design.